    `is inconsistent with the Act or another written law` IS FALSE
    `is inconsistent with the community development statement` IS FALSE
    `is inconsistent with a restricted use condition` IS FALSE
    `is inconsistent with the by-laws of a higher-tier scheme` IS FALSE
    `limits a member's vote beyond barring arrears on ordinary resolutions` IS FALSE
    `restricts selling, leasing, mortgaging or passing on a lot` IS FALSE
    `discharges or modifies an easement or restrictive covenant` IS FALSE
    `restricts an assistance animal of a person with a disability` IS FALSE
    `is unfairly prejudicial, discriminatory, oppressive or unreasonable, as the Tribunal finds` IS FALSE

`a tier 2 pet by-law contrary to the tier 1 by-laws` MEANS `What the by-law does` WITH
    `is beyond any power to make it` IS FALSE
    `is inconsistent with the Act or another written law` IS FALSE
    `is inconsistent with the community development statement` IS FALSE
    `is inconsistent with a restricted use condition` IS FALSE
    `is inconsistent with the by-laws of a higher-tier scheme` IS TRUE
    `limits a member's vote beyond barring arrears on ordinary resolutions` IS FALSE
    `restricts selling, leasing, mortgaging or passing on a lot` IS FALSE
    `discharges or modifies an easement or restrictive covenant` IS FALSE
    `restricts an assistance animal of a person with a disability` IS FALSE
    `is unfairly prejudicial, discriminatory, oppressive or unreasonable, as the Tribunal finds` IS FALSE

