§ `ss 16, 17 -- the community corporation and my place in it`

-- chloe c081: "what is a community titles scheme"; a tier 2 lot owner and the two corporations above her.
#ASSERT `How do I take part in this community corporation` `tier 2` `tier 1` TRUE EQUALS `through the community corporation below it, which is the member`
#ASSERT `How do I take part in this community corporation` `tier 2` `tier 2` TRUE EQUALS `directly, as a member`

#ASSERT `What is my share of the tier 1 common property` `tier 2` 80 1000 150 1000 0 1 EQUALS 0.012
#ASSERT `What is my share of the tier 1 common property` `tier 3` 10 100 200 1000 150 1000 EQUALS 0.003

